-- title:
--   Decay from the large-argument cancellation estimate
-- statement:
--   Assume the explicit large-argument cancellation condition for the interpolation derivative. Then its complexification $G_C$ admits a global bound $\|G_C(x)\|\le C/(1+x^2)$ for some real $C$.
